{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/su4toydksdq1lb6jpsde3x1j2kw7i33.mp3","text":"适当地开个小差吧，那样对身体好。这可是实话，难道您现在不觉得愉快吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/9ao0t6yew019k0p9m40b075f4sib1rt.mp3","text":"“寻找灾害的人”，也就是“灾巡”，按这里的说法应该是叫“天灾信使”吧。又苦、又累、还要被平民和官僚们揶揄，当干员情况会不会好些呢，不会？呵呵，也是。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/ax3l8hbwd6w93ioithu8f0w5hgbd35e.mp3","text":"明日......嗯，原来如此。我亲爱的上司，明天出门的时候记得带伞哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/becauiv1qvc5hylmsd1fc97mow4zj6f.mp3","text":"要是还能留在东国，我也不想走那么远。但是......被这东西植在肉上，哪儿还能被称作“家”呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/nu1c1i5v3zbi44d91pe966tzlj9p2dr.mp3","text":"把薪资让渡给有需要的人，总好过放在屋子里。反正也就那一点，拿出来，放在别人手里，看着他们微笑，亲口说出感谢的话语，多令人欢喜啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/ttgauxrkgww4d30sounk8vwr4q9xouq.mp3","text":"我时常在想，嘴里偶尔滑出的几句古怪话语到底是出自我本人的意识，还是那位素未谋面的神灵大人呢。我的亲族行仪时的话语都摘自古书，但是我总是会不经意间脱口而出，真是困扰呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/s1i0g8009mb61dx2l9s2xwdgs9hajho.mp3","text":"一次一次地跳，神态、姿势、唱词，不允许有一丝区别。有些人乐于让这样的东西充斥生命，还和别人说那能给上天带来喜乐。真是罪过。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/tqzebhckrqjsnuzsiuuy1hodg5vabtf.mp3","text":"我和家族住在山上，离神社不远。山下就是一座佛寺，僧人们晚上都会回到那里。那么问题来了，博士。你觉得会发生些什么？哼哼，结果我留在书桌上了，空闲的时候拆开看看吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/oyr7qt07ftag17d9a86tigq4qn1e0sk.mp3","text":"这么晚了，还在想心事吗？善思善辩是你的优点，可别让它们妨碍睡眠。来，这是东国的熏香，只要闻一下——哎呀，效果是不是好过头了？呼，也罢，今晚就为你守夜吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/igy4m48c5x8z6oej30v5fsxjkhiy801.mp3","text":"闭上双眼，让内心平静下来，好——","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/9n27cnz27hapenht4y6w2jzxi2wu8ru.mp3","text":"初次见面，忘了介绍的礼数可不行。吾乃月禾，曾是东国一地的小小“灾巡”，能成为您的下属，真是不胜荣幸。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/ozpp0fub7sfpnitwl0jd3oac3l0h3bd.mp3","text":"不同的交流方式？有趣......","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/gjvr1brigsgac1acotcm61xhhep4j37.mp3","text":"啊，是酬劳，哎呀哎呀，用在哪里好呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/ksb02s9pe8i8yvifhqmiaqllhrfy8ca.mp3","text":"白夜如火，雾影犹存，您又将驻足何处？慢慢来，可别行错了路。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/pdbk50mjltwthj5y3q2pb0i3cj5qx7w.mp3","text":"不负您的信赖。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/2aburfxks5p85dx7v3irw0hp3the7po.mp3","text":"统率众人，责任重大。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/26rxu9m76uc308g0c8wf6rpiwv4pb4j.mp3","text":"时辰已到，走吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/0ozvrl763monnrudcw844iivnvx0qnl.mp3","text":"比起祈祷，还有更重要的事情要做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/0ul7pjxnonkbdbp7y7pu1m4m7il4yqr.mp3","text":"是了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/e10huz24gydildimqcl6x0sis67zasc.mp3","text":"嗯哼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/jhysygggp427f84m9k4nn4jrjy5s0ga.mp3","text":"除秽。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/gapq3f1sr6hz2w3s9diswz1u3lwrhty.mp3","text":"涤净。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/h5wvhmhdtb555zg3zitg1ycyy1b2bsr.mp3","text":"墨焰升腾，身寸尽去。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/p6kh6ty75v5qm8c7khekibpefjw810w.mp3","text":"暮夜沉溺，再无归路。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/gi384s62q6tg7w2dgdpv9dam0duorf3.mp3","text":"悠悠茫世，惶然无知。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/kyyidmwzhx1fi1c52d6mule00m4gwio.mp3","text":"此耀高昂，他者勿涉！","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/7nx7mintfmv8wygdq3unmou4pt02vjb.mp3","text":"完全帮不上忙呢，这可是件值得庆贺的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/sqqi3vo1r7m7l0lx1566udu2jznovwr.mp3","text":"恭喜恭喜，任务圆满完成了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/ajtlh7lur9sl6wy6p372fxzjrqdjw1g.mp3","text":"不碍结果的小事，我已代为完成，可以离开了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/e4yt3ohidw7zwujh87zjkrkc6kf8bij.mp3","text":"鲁莽行事的结果大多都不尽人意，再思考一下吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/6dk35i3a8sldnqpiexs95a9a4rceglw.mp3","text":"我对住所没有要求，任您安排。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/2yh67gk93c0bqjnn5ytbwtltnfc6wgv.mp3","text":"哦？","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/97n5tkpzedd8nuexbakkofla479uxx9.mp3","text":"有什么不开心的事可以和我说，嗯，什么都行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/ftafv9dyjyvqsbo5906l9uk6na86aue.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/bcfa6c05jhodgeppgvyvget3cv7r5he.mp3","text":"您今年说的第一个字是什么？唔......看来是个好兆头，罗德岛这一年里都会相当顺利呢，恭喜恭喜。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/q4in3bmkrpq1wazrjc7r6ozdrth7c6p.mp3","text":"别来无恙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_343_tknogi/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/5lwt90odkoe4m2x4xccuzim907kaf9q.mp3","text":"适当地开个小差吧，那样对身体好。这可是实话，难道您现在不觉得愉快吗？","alt":"voice/char_343_tknogi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/hrke01ouafmjjop721psffpio1ehoeh.mp3","text":"“寻找灾害的人”，也就是“灾巡”，按这里的说法应该是叫“天灾信使”吧。又苦、又累、还要被平民和官僚们揶揄，当干员情况会不会好些呢，不会？呵呵，也是。","alt":"voice/char_343_tknogi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/axwinjea7sun8pbl5o8jjpr966p1yke.mp3","text":"明日......嗯，原来如此。我亲爱的上司，明天出门的时候记得带伞哦。","alt":"voice/char_343_tknogi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/o8q3qwxdwaw6ey88ql8g2qlxpmn9gdo.mp3","text":"要是还能留在东国，我也不想走那么远。但是......被这东西植在肉上，哪儿还能被称作“家”呢。","alt":"voice/char_343_tknogi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/t6i50bohtcx63ai3sgme883k84h0rgd.mp3","text":"把薪资让渡给有需要的人，总好过放在屋子里。反正也就那一点，拿出来，放在别人手里，看着他们微笑，亲口说出感谢的话语，多令人欢喜啊。","alt":"voice/char_343_tknogi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/cfl